00:04:16.160 --> 00:04:21.280
So if the gods got Oedipus’s game on lock, does he get to do any shot-callin?

00:04:21.280 --> 00:04:23.480
Some ivory tower Gs think he do.

00:04:23.480 --> 00:04:29.660
In spite of all the wack-ass mess that Oedipus gotta grind through, he still got da freedom to chase da truth.

00:04:29.660 --> 00:04:33.180
Every single step of the way, there
be haters tryin to tellin him to slow his roll.

00:04:33.180 --> 00:04:34.780
But Oedipus ain’t no bitch.

00:04:34.780 --> 00:04:37.340
He goes hard in the paint and finds the truth,

00:04:37.340 --> 00:04:42.820
even if it means losin his throne, his eyes, and never havin the ability to get a boner again.

00:04:42.820 --> 00:04:44.060
Naw I mean?

00:04:44.060 --> 00:04:49.060
So, was it worth it? Maybe. But no
matter what, you gotta give it up for our boy, Oedipus.

00:04:49.060 --> 00:04:53.360
Cuz chasin da truth may be the only
real human freedom we got.

00:04:53.360 --> 00:04:58.140
